SUMMARY:21 & 25 The West Mall (Sherway Area Secondary Plan Lands) - Offici
 al Plan Amendment Application
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T130000
UID:1410@haveyoursay.toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Project: City Planning & Development Review Community Consulta
 tion Meetings\n\nThe City of Toronto’s Development Review Division has r
 eceived an application to amend the Official Plan and Sherway Area Seconda
 ry Plan\, including the redesignation of a portion of the lands in Phase 1
  from Mixed Use Areas to Parks to accommodate a new public park\, a revisi
 on in the total number of public streets from two to one\, the addition of
  the proposed public street to Schedule 2\, and the addition of two new pe
 destrian mid-block connections. The application also includes the renaming
  of a public street in Phase 2. Please note that a previous Community Cons
 ultation Meeting was held on July 5\, 2022\, for the associated Zoning By-
 law Amendment application at this site. The Zoning By-law Amendment applic
 ation for the Phase 1 lands is concurrently still under review.\n\nRegistr
 ation: https://events.teams.microsoft.com/event/86ebf707-6d80-4f50-b9e6-d4
 b7362f9747@f0bc8ec6-9ed8-4d0c-9189-411ad949cc65?source=copyLinkLegacyShare
